 "parts": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "scene": "S1",
   "text": "Two men in the Bible never died. Not even once.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.58
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "scene": "S2",
   "text": "The first was Enoch. “Enoch walked with God: and he was not; for God took him.”",
   "start": 3.88,
   "end": 9.68
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "scene": "S2",
   "text": "“By faith Enoch was translated that he should not see death…” because he pleased God.",
   "start": 9.98,
   "end": 15.22
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "scene": "S3",
   "text": "The second was Elijah. And most people get his story wrong.",
   "start": 15.52,
   "end": 19.44
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "scene": "S3",
   "text": "Elijah and Elisha were walking and talking…",
   "start": 19.74,
   "end": 22.28
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "scene": "S4",
   "text": "When suddenly, “there appeared a chariot of fire, and horses of fire.”",
   "start": 22.58,
   "end": 27.04
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "scene": "S5",
   "text": "Most people think Elijah rode that chariot to heaven. But read it again.",
   "start": 28.24,
   "end": 32.8
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "scene": "S6",
   "text": "The chariot “parted them both asunder.” It came between them.",
   "start": 33.1,
   "end": 37.1
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "scene": "S6",
   "text": "And “Elijah went up by a whirlwind into heaven.”",
   "start": 37.4,
   "end": 40.52
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "scene": "S7",
   "text": "Elisha cried, “My father, my father”… and he saw him no more.",
   "start": 41.92,
   "end": 46.7
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "scene": "S7",
   "text": "Only his cloak came floating down.",
   "start": 47.0,
   "end": 49.04
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "scene": "S8",
   "text": "But that’s not the end. Centuries later, on a mountain, Elijah appeared again… talking with Jesus.",
   "start": 49.74,
   "end": 56.72
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "scene": "S9",
   "text": "And Jesus made a promise for you:",
   "start": 57.72,
   "end": 59.58
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "scene": "S9",
   "text": "“Whosoever liveth and believeth in me shall never die.”",
   "start": 59.88,
   "end": 63.32
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "scene": "S10",
   "text": "If you could ask Elijah one question, what would it be? Comment below.",
   "start": 64.52,
   "end": 68.76
  }
 ],
